Challenge data
--------------
The ADB challenge datasets (posted limits, probe speeds, segment geometry as
supplied) are NOT in this repository and are not redistributed in any form.
They are governed by ADB's Fair Data Use Agreement, which requires
confidentiality and deletion within 14 days of participation ending. Under
FDUA §4.4 only derived outputs appear here. `.gitignore` blocks the raw files,
geometry-bearing derivatives, and any per-segment table from which a probe
value could be reconstructed. See DATA_INVENTORY.md for the field-by-field
account.


